cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the results in research/reports, please cite it as below."
title: "MetaNutri---AI-: predicting postprandial glycemic response from meal composition and subject phenotype"
abstract: >-
  A leave-one-subject-out machine-learning study on the CGMacros cohort (45
  subjects, 1,557 meals) with external validation on BIG IDEAs, plus a Streamlit
  demo that serves the frozen models. Predicts 2-hour iAUC, 2-hour AUC and peak
  glucose rise from meal macronutrients and subject phenotype. Not a clinical
  tool.
type: software
